ompleted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in:\nv4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\nv4.7.dev1.official [bf95b6258]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn a TileMapLayer node. Swapping the order of two terrain sets, then undoing the swap. Adds a terrain copy the second terrain set.\n\n\n<img width=\"1849\" height=\"972\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9844a98-a295-44e9-955d-b77932b30389\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the project\nThe TileMapLayer node is selected on startup.\nIn the inspector, Tile Set, Terrain Sets\n\nIt contains three terrains in two terrain sets:\nfirst set:\nElement 0: terrain_set_0/terrain_0 (renamed: a)\nElement 1: terrain_set_0/terrain_1 (renamed: b)\n\nsecond set:\nElement 1: terrain_set_1/terrain_1 (renamed: c)\n\n- Click the swap down terrain set button, to the left of the first terrain set\n\nThe terrain sets have been swapped:\nfirst set:\nElement 0: terrain_set_0/terrain_0 (renamed: c)\n\nsecond set:\nElement 0: terrain_set_1/terrain_0 (renamed: a)\nElement 1: terrain_set_1/terrain_1 (renamed: b)\n\n- Undo, either with ctrl + z, or from the top left menu: Scene > Undo\n\nThe two terrain sets have been unswapped, but\n\n### ISSUE:\nNow there's a copy of terrain b in the second terrain set\n\nfirst set:\nElement 0: terrain_set_0/terrain_0 (renamed: a)\nElement 1: terrain_set_0/terrain_1 (renamed: b)\n\nsecond set:\nElement 0: terrain_set_1/terrain_0 (renamed: c)\nElement 1: terrain_set_1/terrain_1 (renamed: b)\n\n\n### Expected:\nUndo returns to the pre-swapped state:\n\nfirst set:\nElement 0: terrain_set_0/terrain_0 (renamed: a)\nElement 1: terrain_set_0/terrain_1 (renamed: b)\n\nsecond set:\nElement 1: terrain_set_1/terrain_1 (renamed: c)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[issue-undo-reordered-terrain-sets.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25472334/issue-undo-reordered-terrain-sets.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116636/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116636/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}